{"3563500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rogue Maze", "steam_appid": 3563500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/e1d523d83320fc0d4b2b41609e84e45d.poster.avif?t=1782945297\" aria-label=\"A sped-up build sequence from in-game. A translucent blue line is drawn to help with planning before tiles are placed on the board to create the labyrinth. After the first tiles are laid, waves of Rogues (NPCs) try to travel through. The board appears as a rectangular grassy island with lilac trees and castle walls at its edges.\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/e1d523d83320fc0d4b2b41609e84e45d.webm?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/e1d523d83320fc0d4b2b41609e84e45d.mp4?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on your new role as a big tech manager, feudal lord, or casino pit boss and ensure productivity is at an all-time high. Do everything you can to stop underlings from leaving your sight in Rogue Maze, a tower defense roguelike with a twist. Perfect the art of crowd control by building winding mazes filled with obstacles that confuse and fatigue, so no one can ever leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/4859a2d4f6fcbf976c9a0f8a190e9539.poster.avif?t=1782945297\" aria-label=\"A sped-up sequence of the Wrestling Tile in action. Several Rogues—2 neckless wrestlers and 2 anthropomorphic filing cabinets—get into position in a square tile. The tile then rises from the floor as ropes and spotlights appear. A cartoonish cloud obscures a brief fight, after which the ring sinks back to floor level and one combatant walks away triumphant, with a wrestling belt held high.\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/4859a2d4f6fcbf976c9a0f8a190e9539.webm?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/4859a2d4f6fcbf976c9a0f8a190e9539.mp4?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your tile deck after each win to ensure you’re well-equipped to keep everyone preoccupied. Smelly bathrooms, security lasers, and boxing rings are some of the many Special Tiles at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/8e2fa5950cfa8978beb792ea67b2b70d.poster.avif?t=1782945297\" aria-label=\"Demonstrations of the Flashbulb, Food, and Springboard gadgets on some unsuspecting chickens.\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/8e2fa5950cfa8978beb792ea67b2b70d.webm?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/8e2fa5950cfa8978beb792ea67b2b70d.mp4?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Trick in the Book</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An effective manager makes full use of all resources. Buy, upgrade, and discover run passives to maximize your advantages. Confiscate Gadgets from worn-out subordinates before turning these devices back against them. Flashbulbs, springboards, and snacks, oh my!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/c9e935153dd172b70e590d17635805b9.poster.avif?t=1782945297\" aria-label=\"Animated Map View concept art. The map appears as the right hand page in a large book, with block-like pieces that are placed to form the pathway.\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/c9e935153dd172b70e590d17635805b9.webm?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/c9e935153dd172b70e590d17635805b9.mp4?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>On the Move</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through “The Map” between levels, taking control of how you progress to the next stage. Pick a polyomino and design your own route, making stops at shops, vending machines, or food stands along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/423137e61cd922cd0481cc3155541240.poster.avif?t=1782945297\" aria-label=\"A sped-up sequence of various Rogues traveling through a giant green snake wearing a monocle. Rogues can be seen entering the snake’s mouth and traversing through its exposed rib cage. One small Rogue makes its escape from the tail end of the snake.\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/423137e61cd922cd0481cc3155541240.webm?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/423137e61cd922cd0481cc3155541240.mp4?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maze-as-a-Mechanic</strong> – Build labyrinths from tiles that act as both passageways and towers, amplifying the classic mazing thrill of tower defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Gadgets</strong> – Use snacks, springboards, shovels, and shuffles to manipulate your underlings, rearrange your labyrinth, and straighten out your hand. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Personas</strong> – Choose your management style: Big Tech Manager, Feudal Lord, or Casino Boss. Each character deploys unique gadgets for different strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unusual Characters</strong> – Encounter unruly enemies like endless Russian Nesting Dolls, hot-headed Headless Hooligans, and the corner-challenged Monoceros. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depth &amp; Replayability</strong> – Every run is unique with a diverse set of levels, Special Tiles, Gadgets, and more, making each playthrough a new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Workspace</strong> – Make things work for you with a slew of quality-of-life and accessibility options: visual overlays, remappable controls, color-blind friendly options, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music to Match</strong> – A brand new original soundtrack by indie music star Joanna Wang, with Andrew Page, and Baron Jan.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/e1d523d83320fc0d4b2b41609e84e45d.poster.avif?t=1782945297\" aria-label=\"A sped-up build sequence from in-game. A translucent blue line is drawn to help with planning before tiles are placed on the board to create the labyrinth. After the first tiles are laid, waves of Rogues (NPCs) try to travel through. The board appears as a rectangular grassy island with lilac trees and castle walls at its edges.\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/e1d523d83320fc0d4b2b41609e84e45d.webm?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/e1d523d83320fc0d4b2b41609e84e45d.mp4?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on your new role as a big tech manager, feudal lord, or casino pit boss and ensure productivity is at an all-time high. Do everything you can to stop underlings from leaving your sight in Rogue Maze, a tower defense roguelike with a twist. Perfect the art of crowd control by building winding mazes filled with obstacles that confuse and fatigue, so no one can ever leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/4859a2d4f6fcbf976c9a0f8a190e9539.poster.avif?t=1782945297\" aria-label=\"A sped-up sequence of the Wrestling Tile in action. Several Rogues—2 neckless wrestlers and 2 anthropomorphic filing cabinets—get into position in a square tile. The tile then rises from the floor as ropes and spotlights appear. A cartoonish cloud obscures a brief fight, after which the ring sinks back to floor level and one combatant walks away triumphant, with a wrestling belt held high.\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/4859a2d4f6fcbf976c9a0f8a190e9539.webm?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/4859a2d4f6fcbf976c9a0f8a190e9539.mp4?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your tile deck after each win to ensure you’re well-equipped to keep everyone preoccupied. Smelly bathrooms, security lasers, and boxing rings are some of the many Special Tiles at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/8e2fa5950cfa8978beb792ea67b2b70d.poster.avif?t=1782945297\" aria-label=\"Demonstrations of the Flashbulb, Food, and Springboard gadgets on some unsuspecting chickens.\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/8e2fa5950cfa8978beb792ea67b2b70d.webm?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/8e2fa5950cfa8978beb792ea67b2b70d.mp4?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Trick in the Book</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An effective manager makes full use of all resources. Buy, upgrade, and discover run passives to maximize your advantages. Confiscate Gadgets from worn-out subordinates before turning these devices back against them. Flashbulbs, springboards, and snacks, oh my!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/c9e935153dd172b70e590d17635805b9.poster.avif?t=1782945297\" aria-label=\"Animated Map View concept art. The map appears as the right hand page in a large book, with block-like pieces that are placed to form the pathway.\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/c9e935153dd172b70e590d17635805b9.webm?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/c9e935153dd172b70e590d17635805b9.mp4?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>On the Move</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through “The Map” between levels, taking control of how you progress to the next stage. Pick a polyomino and design your own route, making stops at shops, vending machines, or food stands along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/423137e61cd922cd0481cc3155541240.poster.avif?t=1782945297\" aria-label=\"A sped-up sequence of various Rogues traveling through a giant green snake wearing a monocle. Rogues can be seen entering the snake’s mouth and traversing through its exposed rib cage. One small Rogue makes its escape from the tail end of the snake.\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/423137e61cd922cd0481cc3155541240.webm?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/423137e61cd922cd0481cc3155541240.mp4?t=1782945297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maze-as-a-Mechanic</strong> – Build labyrinths from tiles that act as both passageways and towers, amplifying the classic mazing thrill of tower defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Gadgets</strong> – Use snacks, springboards, shovels, and shuffles to manipulate your underlings, rearrange your labyrinth, and straighten out your hand. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Personas</strong> – Choose your management style: Big Tech Manager, Feudal Lord, or Casino Boss. Each character deploys unique gadgets for different strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unusual Characters</strong> – Encounter unruly enemies like endless Russian Nesting Dolls, hot-headed Headless Hooligans, and the corner-challenged Monoceros. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depth &amp; Replayability</strong> – Every run is unique with a diverse set of levels, Special Tiles, Gadgets, and more, making each playthrough a new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Workspace</strong> – Make things work for you with a slew of quality-of-life and accessibility options: visual overlays, remappable controls, color-blind friendly options, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music to Match</strong> – A brand new original soundtrack by indie music star Joanna Wang, with Andrew Page, and Baron Jan.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Tower defense is reinvented in this maze-defense roguelike! Design devious labyrinths fit to exhaust the unfortunate souls that enter by using special tiles that act as both your &quot;towers&quot; and pathway. Deploy gadgets, distractions, and tools to stay a step ahead!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/3455dbceb6d1d01224707e5f4179b7d2d0f64b6a/header.jpg?t=1782945297", "capsule_image": "https://shared.